{"tag":"help-390","found":1,"text":"🪑 The other dugouts. Every other club in your league has a manager. Right now every one of them is made up and wears MADE UP. A real manager only goes in once we have checked on two sources who was in charge on the opening day of the season you start in. Anyone the sim appoints after that first day is made up too, because the real season goes its own way and yours goes yours. A real manager is a name and a date here and nothing more: the game never writes a word he said or a thing he did, never rates him, and the style his team plays is the sim's pick for the club.Worked example. Start a 2026-27 career and tap a rival. A checked chair reads Manager, his name and since Jun 2025, the month he took the job. A chair nobody could check shows a made up name with MADE UP beside it. If the sim sacks a real man in the summer, the news only says the club appointed someone new, and the new man is made up.","box":[25,218,340,408]}
